Recommends: smartmontools
Description: read-only ZFS and host inspection tool (API server, web UI, GUI)
 zfstool runs a small API server (zfstool server) that exposes pool and
 host data over a Unix socket (HTTP). The default command opens a local
 WebKit UI; zfstool web serves the same UI over HTTP (proxies to the API
 server). A systemd unit is included (zfstool-agent.service).
